{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Y<strong>ou like Vibe Coding? You want to track your progress and find a community? Then Vibe Coding Master for Steam is the right solution for you!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Track Your Coding Journey</strong> Watch your skills evolve with beautiful progress visualizations, session tracking, and achievement unlocks that celebrate every breakthrough moment. From your first &quot;Hello World&quot; to complex algorithms, every line of code tells your story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Connect with Fellow Vibe Coders</strong> Join a community that gets it \u2013 developers who code for the love of creation, not just deadlines. Share your projects, celebrate wins together, and find coding buddies who match your energy and interests.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace the art of coding with flow and passion. Vibe Coding Master transforms your development journey into an immersive experience where creativity meets productivity. Whether you're jamming out late-night coding sessions, exploring new languages just for fun, or building that passion project you've been dreaming about, this tool keeps you connected to what makes coding magical.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features that Flow with You:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ambient coding session tracking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access to Vibe Coding Steam Community</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibe Code Master Steam Background</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And one day hopefully Vibe Coding Master Trading cards!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Vibe Coder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3933920/201d11ee70546a86190cccfa28f82e3cbaad5d91.jpg"},{"name":"Click Master","path":"https://cdn.akama